# Ignore generated test/coverage reports in language statistics
report/** linguist-vendored
**/build/** linguist-vendored
**/target/** linguist-vendored
**/htmlReport/** linguist-vendored

# Fallback: exclude all HTML/CSS/JS report assets from language stats
*.html linguist-detectable=false
*.htm linguist-detectable=false
*.css linguist-detectable=false
*.js linguist-detectable=false

